    category: "Linux",
    title: "Mesa 26.3 支援 GFX6 至 GFX8 舊款 AMD GPU，提升 Vulkan 與 Wayland 相容性",
    summary: "Mesa 專案發布了支援 GFX6 至 GFX8 世代舊款 AMD GPU 的 DRM 格式修飾器（format modifiers）。此功能由 Valve 的 Timur Kristóf 貢獻，旨在讓較舊的 Radeon HD 7000（GCN 1.0）到 Polaris 和 Fiji 系列的顯卡，能夠更好地支援基於 Vulkan 的 Wayland 合成器，並提升 OpenGL 與 Vulkan 之間，以及 Zink 驅動實現的相容性。相關的 AMDGPU GFX6 到 GFX8 DRM 格式修飾器已合併至當前的 Linux 7.3 週期，預計於十月穩定發布。為配合此進展，Mesa 側的補丁已合併至 Mesa 26.3，預計於十一月穩定發布。DRM 格式修飾器提供了關於影像緩衝區（image buffers）的平鋪、壓縮等詳細屬性，有助於提升效能和應用場景的通用性。此更新主要針對較舊的 AMD 晶片組提供支援，而 GFX9 及更新的晶片組已由 AMDGPU 和 Mesa 支援。",
    tags: ["Mesa", "AMDGPU", "Vulkan", "Wayland", "GFX6", "GFX8", "Linux"],
    title_en: "Mesa 26.3 Supports GFX6 to GFX8 Legacy AMD GPUs, Improving Vulkan and Wayland Compatibility",
    summary_en: "The Mesa project has released DRM format modifiers supporting legacy AMD GPUs from the GFX6 to GFX8 generations. This feature was contributed by Valve's Timur Kristóf and aims to enable older Radeon HD 7000 (GCN 1.0) through Polaris and Fiji series graphics cards to better support Wayland compositors based on Vulkan, thereby improving compatibility between OpenGL and Vulkan, as well as the compatibility achieved by the Zink driver. The relevant AMDGPU GFX6 to GFX8 DRM format modifiers have been merged into the current Linux 7.3 cycle and are expected to be released stably in October. To align with this progress, the Mesa-side patch has been merged into Mesa 26.3 and is expected to be released stably in November. DRM format modifiers provide detailed attributes for image buffers, such as tiling and compression, which helps improve performance and application versatility. This update primarily provides support for older AMD chipsets, while GFX9 and newer chipsets are already supported by AMDGPU and Mesa.",
    tags_en: ["Mesa", "AMDGPU", "Vulkan", "Wayland", "GFX6", "GFX8", "Linux"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/Mesa-26.3-GFX6-GFX8-Modifiers", lang: "EN" }
    ]
