    category: "Windows",
    title: "Windows 11 24H2/25H2 預覽版發布：新增 AI 功能、檔案總管與藍牙體驗優化",
    summary: "微軟發布了 Windows 11 24H2/25H2 的 Release Preview Build 26100.9539/26200.9539，透過分階段和正常方式推送更新。本次更新著重於提升使用者體驗與功能性，包含多項重大改進。在檔案總管方面，新增了對 HTML 檔案的預覽功能，並改善了非 HTML 檔案（如 PDF）的自動預覽，同時優化了檔案狀態保留與詳細資訊窗格的可靠性。此外，新增了「Tips」小工具，提供 Windows 功能的簡短指引。系統層面也大幅強化了藍牙連接的穩定性與相容性，特別是在語音通話和 LE Audio 設備的支援上，並修復了相關的崩潰問題。另在無障礙功能方面，新增了「Open apps maximized」設定，可自動最大化應用程式視窗，提升使用者操作一致性。整體而言，本次更新旨在透過持續的創新，為 Windows 11 提供更完善、更可靠的日常使用體驗。",
    tags: ["Windows 11", "24H2", "25H2", "Windows Insider", "File Explorer", "藍牙", "Open apps maximized"],
    title_en: "Windows 11 24H2/25H2 Preview Builds Released: Enhanced AI Features, File Explorer, and Bluetooth Experience",
    summary_en: "Microsoft has released the Release Preview Builds 26100.9539/26200.9539 for Windows 11 24H2/25H2, distributing the updates through phased and normal channels. This update focuses on enhancing user experience and functionality, including several major improvements. In File Explorer, a new preview function for HTML files has been added, and automatic previewing for non-HTML files (such as PDFs) has been improved. Furthermore, file status retention and the reliability of the Details pane have been optimized. Additionally, a new 'Tips' widget has been introduced to provide brief guides on Windows features. At the system level, Bluetooth connection stability and compatibility have been significantly strengthened, particularly for voice calls and LE Audio device support, along with fixes for related crashes. Regarding accessibility, a new 'Open apps maximized' setting has been added, which automatically maximizes application windows, improving user operational consistency. Overall, this update aims to provide a more comprehensive and reliable daily usage experience for Windows 11 through continuous innovation.",
