    title: "Theori主導建構實戰型AI訓練環境，助力國家級資安基礎模型開發",
    summary: "Theori宣布將主導政府「專精資安AI基礎模型開發」計畫，建構一個基於其自研AI安全解決方案「진트(Xint)」的實戰型AI訓練環境。此專案由科學技術情報通信部推動，旨在應對高階化資安威脅，並確保國內自主的資安AI技術能力。Theori將貢獻其在攻擊性安全領域累積的漏洞研究、分析經驗和實戰數據，特別是其開發並運營的基於Agent的漏洞偵測與驗證技術。具體而言，Theori負責建構「Harness」（訓練環境）以及用於實戰駭客情境模擬的SFT（Supervised Fine-Tuning）和RLVR（Reinforcement Learning with Verifiable Rewards）環境。這使得AI模型不僅能生成安全知識，更能實際在環境中解決問題並進行可驗證的學習。政府將提供256張B200 GPU資源，目標是建構一個700B級的MoE結構資安基礎模型。",
    tags: ["Theori", "Theori", "Xint", "AI基礎模型", "資安", "Harness", "SFT"],
    title_en: "Theori to Lead Construction of Practical AI Training Environment for National-Level Cybersecurity Foundation Model Development",
    summary_en: "Theori announced it will lead the government's 'Specialized Cybersecurity AI Foundation Model Development' project by building a practical AI training environment based on its proprietary AI security solution, 'Xint'. This project is driven by the Ministry of Science and Technology and aims to address advanced cybersecurity threats while ensuring the nation's independent cybersecurity AI technological capabilities. Theori will contribute its accumulated vulnerability research, analysis experience, and practical data from the offensive security domain, particularly its Agent-based vulnerability detection and verification technology. Specifically, Theori is responsible for constructing the 'Harness' (the training environment) and the SFT (Supervised Fine-Tuning) and RLVR (Reinforcement Learning with Verifiable Rewards) environments used for practical hacking scenario simulations. This allows the AI model not only to generate security knowledge but also to solve problems and undergo verifiable learning within the environment. The government will provide 256 B200 GPU resources, with the goal of building a 700B-level MoE structured cybersecurity foundation model.",
    tags_en: ["Theori", "Xint", "AI Foundation Model", "Cybersecurity", "Harness", "SFT"],
